  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot with a lid over medium heat. Add the onion and cook for 4 minutes, until soft.",
    "Stir in the garlic, cumin, and paprika. Cook for 30 seconds, until fragrant.",
    "Add the rice and stir for 1 minute to coat it in the oil.",
    "Pour in the water and add the salt. Bring to a boil, then stir in the black beans.",
    "Cover, reduce the heat to low, and cook for 15 minutes, until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed.",
    "Scatter the frozen corn over the rice, cover again, and let it stand off the heat for 5 minutes, until the corn is hot.",
    "Fluff everything together with a fork. Stir in 1/2 cup of the salsa.",
    "Divide among 4 bowls. Top with the remaining salsa and the diced avocado."
